     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Closing this as the documentation already exists.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "We'll want some additional documentation for setting up a reverse proxy when not using apache, which will be handled in ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "attrs": {
           "url": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-3937#icft=FCREPO-3937"
          },
          "type": "inlineCard"
         },
         {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "It would also be good to reorganize the wiki as the Deployment section shouldn't be nested under guides but at a higher level. That is something we'll likely have to look at separately and requires more of an evaluation of the wiki space.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
