     "body": "<p>Closing this as the documentation already exists.</p>\n\n<p>We'll want some additional documentation for setting up a reverse proxy when not using apache, which will be handled in \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-3937\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-3937\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"add configuration instructions for Caddy reverse proxy to deployment instructions\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10300?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-3937\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-complete jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Received</span>\n            </span>\n. </p>\n\n<p>It would also be good to reorganize the wiki as the Deployment section shouldn't be nested under guides but at a higher level. That is something we'll likely have to look at separately and requires more of an evaluation of the wiki space.</p>",
